    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「今日は知的な衣装で攻めてみました、どうです、もちろん似合ってますよねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「おや……見とれちゃってるみたいですねぇ？　そんなにわたしが魅力的に見えちゃうんでしょうか……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「転校生くんはとんだ白衣フェチですねぇ、じろじろ見るなら、お金を取りますよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「うふふ～♪　どうしてわたしが白衣を着てるのか、ですかぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「まずはそこに気が向くんですねぇ、自分の体がなぜか縛り付けられていることのほうは、後回しですか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「他人本位なのはいいことですけど、いつか損しますよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「ともあれ……まずは質問にお答えしましょうか♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「わたしがどうして、白衣を着ているのか……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「それは、いまから転校生くんに、ある『実験』をしようと思ってるからです♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「そう暴れないでください。顔も青くしなくていいですよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「べつに、切ったり縫ったりはしませんからねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「それに、ゴム素材で縛ってるから、暴れたらケガしちゃいますし？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「うふふ～♪　わたしがケガさせるのはむしろ『ごほうび』になっちゃうかもしれませんねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「そっちのコースがいいってことでしたら、道具とかも調達してきますけどねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「なんて、真に受けないでくださいねぇ、転校生くん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「わたしが手を出したら、Ａ組のいろんなひと……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「なつみちゃんとか、さあやちゃんに殺されかねませんからねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「『君子危うきに近寄らず』とは、まさにこのことですねぇ……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「え？　『実験の内容を教えてほしい』ですかぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「せっかちですねぇ、わかりました。それじゃ、本題に入りましょう」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「転校生くんは、もうじき職業体験があるのを知ってますよねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「ええ。二年生を無理やり社会に放り出して、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「労働の大変さやめんどくささ、理不尽さやつらさを学ぶ行事です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「しかも、体験する生徒は自分の希望した職業ではなく、学院側が勝手に決めた場所へと送られるんです！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「考えただけで、ぞっとしますねぇ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「いくら学校行事とはいえ、わたしみたいに労働への反発を感じている生徒が、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「仮病や急用で参加しないことになるのは、目に見えてます」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「と、そこで学院側が考えたのが、このビデオによる、事前実習♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「職業体験の当日に休もうとしている悪い生徒には、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「この特製映像を見てもらうことで、労働の素晴らしさややりがいを感じてもらう、という算段です♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「これからの『実験』では、転校生くんには映像を見ていただきますねぇ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「この映像は、ぜったいに労働はしたくない！　と考えるわたしのような生徒を、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「無理やりにでも職業体験に参加させるためのアイテム……もとい拷問器具です♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「うふふ～♪　拷問器具だなんて、聞こえが悪いですかねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「でも、実際に見てみればわかりますよ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「これを見れば、勤労意欲が湧いてくる。嫌でも勤労意欲が湧いてくる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「ぜったいに働きたくないと考えていても、労働は素晴らしいと教え込まれる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「うふふ～♪　誰が作ったのか知りませんけど、ずいぶんと惨たらしい発想じゃないですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「わたしはそういう考え、嫌いじゃないですけどねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「……どうして勤労意欲があるはずの転校生くんが、この映像を見せられるのか、ですかぁ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「転校生くんは勤労意欲のある素晴らしい生徒ですけど、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「そのぶん、都合のいい生徒として、さいしょの『実験台』として扱われちゃったんでしょうねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「わたしに『実験』を依頼したひとたちも、」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「学院唯一の男子生徒である転校生くんなら、きっと大丈夫だろう、と妙な太鼓判を押してましたからねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「ま、そういうわけで……さっそく、見てもらうことにしましょう♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「もし、協力してくれるなら簡単なお礼くらいはさせてもらいますので、期待しててくださいねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 44,
    "dress": "old-white",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-white_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 492
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「うふふ～♪　おとなしくしてくれたということは、『実験』を手伝ってくれるということで大丈夫ですねぇ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ゆう",
    "text": "「まずは、まばたきしたり、目をそらしたりできないように、頭に特殊な器具をつけさせてもらいますねぇ♪」"
  },
